  "notes": "Source tables provide data for General Employees, Policemen, and Firemen separately. The 'Number' column is the sum of the 'Total' count columns from all three tables. The 'AverageBenefit' is derived from the ratio of 'Total Monthly Benefits' to 'Total' count, then annualized (multiplied by 12). The '59 & Under' bucket (covering ages 50-59) is excluded from the target grid as it does not align with the specific 5-year bands requested (50-54, 55-59) and splitting it evenly would be an assumption not supported by the data granularity. The '90 & Over' bucket is split evenly across the target rows 90-94, 95-99, and 100 & over.",
